            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is not in combat, pick a friendly **^^Moonclan^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if the face of the Bad Moon is **Cacklin&apos;** this turn. On a 3+, the target has **^^Ward (5+)^^** until the start of your next turn. On a 6+, also add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target&apos;s melee weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
