          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If any damage points are allocated to an enemy unit by attacks made with this unit&apos;s **Noxious Vomit**, that unit is **drenched in vomit** until the start of your next turn.
While a unit is **drenched in vomit**:
• Subtract 1 from save rolls for that unit.
• Ignore positive modifiers to save rolls for that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
