            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. You can spend up to 3 **rage dice**. If you do:
• Add X to the roll, where X is the number of **rage dice** spent.
• If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7.
