            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **Moonclan Stabbas** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, pick 1 of the following effects:
***Get Back &apos;Ere!:*** If the target is not in combat, you can return D6 slain models to it.
